### Hephaestus Catalog — IntelliJ HTTP Client scenarios (run the service with the "local" profile first)
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Create a category
POST {{base}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Swords"}

> {% client.global.set("categoryId", response.body.id); %}

### Create an item (idempotent: resend with the same key -> same response, Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST {{base}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1

{"name": "Bronze sword", "description": "Sharp", "price": {"amount": "120.00", "currency": "EUR"}, "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}"}

> {% client.global.set("itemId", response.body.id); %}

### Search
GET {{base}}/api/items?category={{categoryId}}&q=sword&sort=-price&page=0&size=20

### Patch with the current ETag -> 200, ETag "1"
PATCH {{base}}/api/items/{{itemId}}
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json
If-Match: "0"

{"description": null, "price": {"amount": "99.90"}}

### Replace with a stale ETag -> 412 Precondition Failed
PUT {{base}}/api/items/{{itemId}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "0"

{"name": "Stale", "price": {"amount": "1.00", "currency": "EUR"}, "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}"}

### Delete without If-Match -> 428 Precondition Required
DELETE {{base}}/api/items/{{itemId}}

### Unsupported API version -> 400
GET {{base}}/api/categories
API-Version: 2
